{
    "title": "Remote for Apple TV",
    "description": "This application allows you to control Apple TV. Just connect Android device and media player to the same Wi-Fi network and you will be able to control it using a mobile device after a simple pairing routine.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Fully functional Apple TV remote control;\r\n- A large touchpad for content navigation;\r\n- Keyboard for convenient text entry;\r\n- Playback control;\r\n- Quick access to all apps;\r\n- Automatic connection to a device;\r\n- Wear OS;\r\n\r\nSupported devices:\r\n- Apple TV (4th generation), using tvOS 9.2.1 or later;\r\n- Apple TV (3rd generation), using Apple TV Software 7.2.1.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nKraftwerk 9, LTD is not an affiliated entity of Apple Inc, and \u201cRemote for Apple TV\u201d app is not an official product of Apple.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This application allows you to control Apple TV. Just connect Android device and media player to the same Wi-Fi network and you will be able to control it using a mobile device after a simple pairing routine.<br><br>Key features:<br>- Fully functional Apple TV remote control;<br>- A large touchpad for content navigation;<br>- Keyboard for convenient text entry;<br>- Playback control;<br>- Quick access to all apps;<br>- Automatic connection to a device;<br>- Wear OS;<br><br>Supported devices:<br>- Apple TV (4th generation), using tvOS 9.2.1 or later;<br>- Apple TV (3rd generation), using Apple TV Software 7.2.1.<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>Kraftwerk 9, LTD is not an affiliated entity of Apple Inc, and \u201cRemote for Apple TV\u201d app is not an official product of Apple.",
